td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/cb498bb1-1c8d-49c7-a3d7-7c3e355e2f83/CANN/ops-transformer?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_style</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_f22d6251a403435cb43d00161e73dc90/ecf19a2d317fcb16ad8c604e232f2b40?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_codespell_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_link_validity_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_resource_existence_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_tag_closed_check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>StaticCheck_markdownlint</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_checkpr</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3dd7f759b16146a08dcb8b11e5426b56&pipelineRunId=a6e5c3b577b6478f8c58dd77bc9cc9e3&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/8321/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-06 17:42:20] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178770180,"discussion_id":"fbadbc479adff49a84c88283434631dbf9a35207","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 FA MLA noquant 场景下的一个 bug：当 batch 的 `s2LoopEndIdx<=0` 被 skip 时，`multiCoreInnerIdx` 仍会递增，导致 `softmaxSumBuf`/`softmaxMaxBuf` 的 mod3 槽位索引与实际写入次数错位，在 `PRELOAD_N=1` 场景下引发 vec1 覆写 vec2 未读的 softmax 状态，最终造成 `attention_out` 计算错误。修复方法是将 `multiCoreInnerIdx` 的自增逻辑从 `ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1`（skip 检查之前）移动到 `Process()` 的 skip 检查之后，确保仅在真正执行 task 时才递增，从而保证槽位索引与实际写入次数一一对应。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`multiCoreInnerIdx` 自增位置调整**：将 `multiCoreInnerIdx++` 从 `ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1` 函数末尾移除，改到 `Process()` 函数中 `continue` 跳过逻辑之后，确保仅在 task 真正执行时才递增计数器。\n- **skip 块不再影响槽位索引**：通过在 skip 条件判断 (`if (((s1NoNeedCalc || s2NoNeedCalc) && !lastLoopThisCore) || lastBnNoNeedCalc)`) 的 `continue` 之后执行 `multiCoreInnerIdx++`，使得被跳过的 gS1 块不会消耗 mod3 槽位，消除了 softmax 状态覆写问题。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T19:02:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:02:12+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178836481,"discussion_id":"677b0df188c416604e4e652b6b442065f707c07a","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*comic97*](https://gitcode.com/comic97)","created_at":"2026-07-07T10:11:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T10:11:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178839415,"discussion_id":"5f2912b7847521ebb654c3c42d7e9614a60a5a3c","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-07-07T10:21:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T10:21:48+08:00","user":{"id":"68b518bc1e2c5615789dcedf","login":"comic97","object_id":"68b518bc1e2c5615789dcedf","name":"comic97","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/comic97"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178839445,"discussion_id":"e7a8594f9101d2b73d5534017ad79599e38588a5","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*comic97*](https://gitcode.com/comic97)","created_at":"2026-07-07T10:21:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T10:21:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295